We believe these elements can foster a pragmatic compromise, in which ambitious, globally binding goals are met with flexible implementation timetables and robust support for developing nations. Through mutual understanding and respect for local realities, we can together advance an equitable carbon tax regime that catalyzes both environmental stewardship and sustainable development.

Thank you.



